  "keyFeatures": [
    "Distributed, fault-tolerant event streaming at massive scale",
    "High-throughput, low-latency publish-subscribe messaging",
    "Persistent, replayable log storage with configurable retention",
    "Consumer groups for parallel, load-balanced message processing",
    "Kafka Streams for stateful stream processing without external systems",
    "Kafka Connect for data integration with hundreds of connectors",
    "Schema Registry for enforcing data contracts with Avro/JSON Schema",
    "Exactly-once semantics with transactional producers",
    "KRaft mode: ZooKeeper-free, self-managed metadata quorum",
    "Rich CLI tooling for topic management, consumer groups, and debugging"
  ],
